# Custom-prefix bootstrap pin: emacshell-distro flavor (aarch64).
#
# Same prefix problem as pins/bootstrap-termux.sha256, but built with
# TERMUX_APP_PACKAGE=tech.khalidrafi.emacshell.distro, and with proot and
# proot-distro added to the bootstrap package set so the distro flavor can
# run the bundled Alpine rootfs (and install other distros at runtime)
# without a first network round-trip.  See scripts/build-bootstrap.sh.
#
# Until that CI job has produced and reviewed a build, this file holds a
# PLACEHOLDER instead of a real pin.  scripts/install-bootstrap (Gradle
# task in app/build.gradle) refuses to build the APK in that state, so a
# wrong-prefix bootstrap can never ship silently.
#
# To fill this in after running scripts/build-bootstrap.sh:
#
#   <sha256 of bootstrap-aarch64.zip>
#
# Layout expected by the build:
#   bootstrap/distro/bootstrap-aarch64.zip     (gitignored build output)

PLACEHOLDER
